   4:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
   5:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *
   6:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * @file vsc8221_phy.c
   7:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * @author Microchip FPGA Embedded Systems Solutions
   8:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * @brief Microsemi VSC8221 PHY interface driver implementation to support the
   9:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * PolarFire SoC Discovery Kit.
  10:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *
  11:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * Will need to modify FW based on MSS GPIO configuration.
  12:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *
  13:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * Discovery Kit CMODE strap settings are as follows:
  14:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *
  15:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * CMODE 0: 1011 - PHY Address = 11
  16:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * CMODE 1: 1010 - SFP Disabled, PHY Addr[4] = 0, SIGDET = output, 50ohm SERDES
  17:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *                 impedance
  18:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * CMODE 2: 1111 - PHY Operating Mode = SGMii to CAT5 Media, SCLK disabled.
  19:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * CMODE 3: 1000 - AN Advertise 10/100/1000BASE-T HDX, FDX, SQE Disabled,
  20:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *                 LED[2:0] = {Link/Activity, Link/Activity, Fault}
  21:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *
  22:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * VSC_RESTET is connected to A14, GPIO127NB1 and VSC_TXDIS_SRESET is connected
  23:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * to E20, GPIO15NB1. These are both tied high internally in the reference
  24:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  * design.
  25:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  *
  26:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c ****  */
  27:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8221_phy.c **** 
